    enonce: "<span class=\"q\">1) </span>احسب بأيسر طريقة: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">A = [<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">11</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span> + (-<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">14</span></span>)] + [(-<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span>) + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">14</span></span>]</span><br><span class=\"q\">2) </span>احسب بأيسر طريقة: احسب: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">B = |-<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span> + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>| - |-<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span> + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span>|</span><br><span class=\"q\">3) </span>احسب بأيسر طريقة: احسب: جد العدد الكسري النسبي x بحيث: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"den\">9</span></span> + x = 0</span><br><span class=\"q\">4) </span>احسب بأيسر طريقة: احسب: جد العدد الكسري النسبي x بحيث: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">x + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"den\">6</span></span> = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">9</span><span class=\"den\">10</span></span></span><br><span class=\"q\">5) </span>احسب بأيسر طريقة: احسب: جد العدد الكسري النسبي x بحيث: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\"><span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">6</span></span> + (<span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">4</span></span> - x) = <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"den\">6</span></span></span><br><span class=\"q\">6) </span>احسب بأيسر طريقة: احسب: جد العدد الكسري النسبي x بحيث: <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"expr\">|x| + <span class=\"frac\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"den\">5</span></span> = 1</span>",
